%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 612
%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 16: one little light
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 116 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/night cb-light
240 cb-harbour-sky
% ten boats home, behind
/cb-face -1 def
0 1 8 { /i exch def 40 i 52 mul add 250 13 cb-sails i get cb-boat } for
/cb-boatlight true def 520 250 10 cb-gpblue cb-boat /cb-boatlight false def
/cb-face 1 def
-9 700 70 110 cb-pier
0 600 0.2 cb-fog
70 70 300 cb-mama
% Grandpa lifts Ana up, lamp and all: she sits on his arm
/cb-gparm /lift def 270 70 360 cb-grandpa /cb-gparm /reach def
/cb-arm /up def /cb-lamp true def /cb-lit true def /cb-glowr 0.6 def
270 360 0.24 mul add 70 360 0.62 mul add 170 0.13 mul sub 170 cb-ana
/cb-arm /down def /cb-lamp false def /cb-lit false def /cb-glowr 0.8 def
cb-paper cb-rgb
(He lifts Ana up, lamp and all. \252Ten boats home,\272 says Grandpa, \252and one little light.\272) 56 584 500 /center cb-text pop
/cb-foliorgb cb-paper def 16 cb-folio
